      "id": "teach_4",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "When two workers work at the same time, their rates add.\n\nA: 12 days → 1/12.\nB: 18 days → 1/18.\nTogether: 1/12 + 1/18 = 5/36 per day.",
