      "id": "teach_7",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The 'whole job' can be more than one object.\n\nIf A makes 1 pair in 4 days and B makes 1 pair in 12 days, together they make 1/3 pair per day. Two pairs therefore take 6 days.",
