      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "You can now move cleanly between time, rate, and work.\n\nWhole job = 1.\nOne-day work = 1 ÷ completion time.\nWork done = rate × time.\nTime needed = work ÷ rate.\n\nNext, we use those rates to uncover a worker whose speed is hidden inside a team.",
